\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces WASM rerun results used in the Evaluation section. Panel a reports five-node upgrade completion latency and post-event readiness tails. Panels b and c compare \texttt  {eth\_call} latency and \texttt  {eth\_estimateGas} for the WASM-backed Upgrade, Solidity Contract, and Precompile paths after setup. Upgrade consistency is not plotted or reported as a separate experiment.}}{11}{figure.5.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:wasm-evaluation}{{2}{11}{WASM rerun results used in the Evaluation section. Panel a reports five-node upgrade completion latency and post-event readiness tails. Panels b and c compare \texttt {eth\_call} latency and \texttt {eth\_estimateGas} for the WASM-backed Upgrade, Solidity Contract, and Precompile paths after setup. Upgrade consistency is not plotted or reported as a separate experiment}{figure.5.2}{}}
