\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Upload and deployment cost for the auxiliary Lab1 cost experiment. The upgrade path uses \texttt  {CodeStorage.uploadCode} and emits an upgrade event, whereas the Contract path deploys a Solidity implementation. The figure reports total transaction-level setup cost, not an isolated event-log gas component.}}{12}{figure.5.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:lab1-deployment-cost}{{3}{12}{Upload and deployment cost for the auxiliary Lab1 cost experiment. The upgrade path uses \texttt {CodeStorage.uploadCode} and emits an upgrade event, whereas the Contract path deploys a Solidity implementation. The figure reports total transaction-level setup cost, not an isolated event-log gas component}{figure.5.3}{}}
